{"id":60987,"ord":105,"n_segments":146,"prev":60986,"next":60988,"doc":{"id":"70980","title":"70980_Quinn Wilson oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Quinn Wilson","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/70980/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=70980"},"chapter":"Breakup of Hines band to Lefty Bates","title":"What became of Walter Fuller","category":"person_portrait","summary":"Fuller in San Diego.","period":null,"year_from":null,"year_to":null,"words":139,"start":[155,6],"end":[156,4],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=70980#s60987","tags":{"places":[{"name":"San Diego","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"California","focus":0,"type":"state"},{"name":"Louisville","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"Randolph Street","focus":0,"type":"street","in":"Chicago"}],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Walter Fuller's band","focus":1,"leader":"Walter Fuller"}]},"people":[{"name":"Walter Fuller","qid":"Q2439893","n":1}],"story":{"theme":28,"theme_name":"Illness, injury and the deaths of colleagues","community":52,"community_name":"Illness, injury and death among jazz musicians","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":155,"b":6,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"I seem to remember coming up here -- I lived in Louisville, coming up here around 1944 and walking along Randolph Street, and seeing Walter Fuller's band."},{"p":155,"b":7,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Yeah, I wasn't with him then."},{"p":155,"b":8,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Yeah, but he still --"},{"p":155,"b":9,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Still had a small band."},{"p":155,"b":10,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Yeah. When did he pass?"},{"p":155,"b":11,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"No, he's not dead."},{"p":155,"b":12,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"He's not?"},{"p":155,"b":13,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"No, he went to California."},{"p":155,"b":14,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Lives in California?"},{"p":155,"b":15,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Yeah, and he had a small combo for"},{"p":156,"b":0,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"years in San Diego. Then he got to be an officer in the union down there, and I don't know what he's doing now. I think he's still officer in the union down there."},{"p":156,"b":1,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"I'll be darned. One of my favorite towns -- San Diego. I like the climate."},{"p":156,"b":2,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":156,"b":3,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"I didn't know that. That comes as a surprise. For some reason I thought that he had died."},{"p":156,"b":4,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"No."}]}